          "name": "TextBlock",
          "options": {
            "title": "Mendara is Different",
            "subtitle": "Accessing help for PND is often overwhelming and costly. Mendara is built to be accessible, effective, and right there when you need it.",
            "body": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Our micro-intervention approach provides support in moments of need, offering tools to manage emotions, ease overwhelming thoughts, and guide you through the journey to recovery. Welcome to a program that truly understands your needs and adapts to your life.</p>",
